{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30870","headline":"送武陵王将军 · 马戴","name":"送武陵王将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河外今无事，将军有战名。\n艰难长剑缺，功业少年成。\n晓仗亲云陛，寒宵突禁营。\n朱旗身外色，玉漏耳边声。\n开合谈宾至，调弓过鴈惊。\n爲儒多不达，见学请长缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}